  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You are skilled at sizing up your opponents and have a good sense of your odds in a fight.</p><p>As an <strong>Action</strong>, you can study an enemy. If you do so, you may choose to learn <strong>2</strong> of the following pieces of information:</p><ul><li><p>Whether their <strong>Body</strong> is higher or lower than yours.</p></li><li><p>Whether their <strong>Stamina</strong> is higher or lower than yours.</p></li><li><p>Whether their total <strong>XP</strong> is higher or lower than yours.</p></li><li><p>Whether the enemy is a <strong>Minion</strong>, a <strong>Warrior</strong>, an <strong>Elite</strong>, or a <strong>Champion</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
